  m_text: "G\xFCm\xFC\u015F Nitrat (AgNO_3): G\xFCm\xFC\u015F kayna\u011F\u0131.Amonyak
    (NH_3): G\xFCm\xFC\u015F iyonlar\u0131n\u0131 kompleks hale getirmek i\xE7in.Glikoz
    \xC7\xF6zeltisi: G\xFCm\xFC\u015F\xFC indirgeyecek olan \u015Feker \xE7\xF6zeltisi.Deney
    T\xFCp\xFC: Aynan\u0131n olu\u015Faca\u011F\u0131 cam y\xFCzey.S\u0131cak Su
    Banyosu (Beher + S\u0131cak Su): Tepkimeyi h\u0131zland\u0131rmak i\xE7in nazik
    \u0131s\u0131tma sa\u011Flar."
